'''April Gauntlet''' (4月強襲！, ''4 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''April Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during April and was added in the [[Version 11.3 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Teacher! It's Spring! (Monthly Event)|Teacher! It's Spring!]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The April Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Teacher!''' (春だよ！ Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Teacher! Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[April Gauntlet/Teacher! Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*April Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Teacher! It's Spring! (Monthly Event)|Teacher! It's Spring!]].

